  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: dates.published,
    modifiedTime: dates.modified,
    author: author.name,
    section: "Protein Powder",
    tags: [
      "best protein powder for diabetics",
      "protein powder for diabetes",
      "low sugar protein powder",
      "protein shakes for diabetics"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Buyer's Guide"} badge={"Updated November 2026"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Best Protein Powder for Diabetics</Fragment>
      A good protein powder for diabetes is mostly about what is not in it: sugar, maltodextrin and hidden carbohydrate. These eight are ranked on the label, with the medication caveats your care team should weigh in on.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a>
      <a href="#top-picks">Our Top Picks</a>
      <a href="#blood-sugar">Protein and Blood Sugar</a>
      <a href="#carbs-and-sugar">Sugar and Hidden Carbs</a>
      <a href="#sweeteners">Sweeteners</a>
      <a href="#fiber">Fiber</a>
      <a href="#meal-replacement">Meal Replacement vs Protein</a>
      <a href="#kidneys-and-meds">Kidneys and Medication</a>
      <a href="#how-we-picked">How We Picked</a>
      <a href="#mistakes">Common Mistakes</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
