            These eight are ranked on label analysis, not on our own glucose testing or a tasting panel: total carbohydrate and sugar per serving first, then protein dose, fiber, sweetener choice, certification status and cost per serving. Six are protein-only products; two add fiber or a full meal-style formula for people who use a shake to replace breakfast. Figures come from each label at the time of writing and vary by flavor, so check the exact flavor you buy, and confirm any certification in the certifier's own database.
          </p>

